      "bounds": {
        "id": "role-bounds-v1",
        "expression": "union of world AABBs in the visible/active subtree; hidden nodes hide descendants; rigid Mesh local geometry bounds times world matrix; SkinnedMesh posed vertices via getVertexPosition; InstancedMesh per-instance matrices; BatchedMesh active visible instances with geometry ranges and matrices computed into locals; Sprite camera-facing world quad (world scale, centre, material rotation and size attenuation); Line and Points excluded; no renderable is empty; no engine boundingBox or boundingSphere cache writes; computation failures report error with message"
      },
      "rect": "unclamped viewport [x0,y0,x1,y1] of all 8 world-AABB corners; omitted unless every corner depth \u003E nearClip",
      "crown": {
        "id": "bounds-top-center",
        "expression": "viewport [x,y,depth] of ((min.x\u002Bmax.x)/2,max.y,(min.z\u002Bmax.z)/2), a head proxy, not the maximum projected top corner"
      },
      "rule": "one entry for subject, each with role and a distinct lookAt; absent roles never require a live role binding; behind means all corners have depth \u003C= 0; straddles-near means not behind but at least one corner depth \u003C= nearClip (rect omitted); errors never fail a take; aim uses each engine\u0027s legacy bounds; reviews use role-bounds-v1",
